<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Development up on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Lanka Development up on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Development Finance Corporation of Ceylon Ltd rose 3.3 percent or 10 ruepes to 316 rupees on Thursday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Since the company is seen reporting improved growth for the period to June 30, investors want to buy before the results come out later this month,&quot; said a broker.</p>
<p>Develoment Finance is one of two blue chip developnment finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
